[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "open-scotch 4...Nf6"]
[Name "The Scotch: 5.Nc3"]

5. Nc3 { Guards e4 and keeps the knights on. }
5... Bb4 { The same pin as in the last line. White scores 47% after it. [%cal Rb4e1,Rf6e4] }
6. Nxc6 { The most common move, and it leads to a position you know. }
6... bxc6 { Takes towards the centre. After 7.Bd3 the game is back in the line with 6.Nc3. }
7. Bd3 *
